<div class="wb-check-options">
  <p class="wb-attack-reasons" {{#unless reasons.length}}hidden{{/unless}}>{{#if reasons.length}}Disadvantage: {{#each reasons}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}; {{/unless}}{{/each}}.{{/if}}</p>
  {{#if loading}}<p>{{#if shots}}{{shots}} of {{loading}} shots loaded.{{else}}Empty: reload before attacking.{{/if}}</p>{{/if}}
  {{#if partners.length}}<label><span>Hands</span>
    <select name="hands"><option value="">This weapon only</option>{{#each partners}}<option value="{{id}}">Both: with {{name}} in the off hand</option>{{/each}}</select>
  </label>{{/if}}
  {{#if modes.[1]}}<label><span>Attack</span>
    <select name="mode">{{#each modes}}<option value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
  </label>{{/if}}
  {{#if stats.[1]}}<label><span>Attack with</span>
    <select name="stat">{{#each stats}}<option value="{{key}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
  </label>{{/if}}
  {{#if versatile}}<label><span>Grip</span>
    <select name="grip"><option value="one">One hand · {{damage}}</option><option value="two">Two hands · {{versatileDamage}} (counts as Two-handed)</option></select>
  </label>{{/if}}
  {{#if singularity}}<label class="wb-check-toggle" data-tooltip="DEX 28: if this attack hits, it's a critical hit. A miss still spends it for the round."><input
    type="checkbox"
    name="singularity"
    {{#unless singularity.ready}}disabled{{/unless}}
  > Declare Singularity ({{singularity.text}})</label>{{/if}}
  {{#if canRange}}<label class="wb-check-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="longRange"> Past normal range (disadvantage)</label>{{/if}}
  {{#if mount}}<label class="wb-check-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="mounted"> Mounted</label>
  <label><span>Feet moved in a straight line this turn</span><input type="number" name="mountedFeet" value="0" min="0" step="5"></label>{{/if}}
  {{#if opportunity}}<label class="wb-check-toggle"><input
    type="checkbox"
    name="spendReaction"
    {{#if spendAp}}checked{{/if}}
  > Opportunity attack: spend a reaction, no AP ({{reactionsLeft}} left)</label>
  {{else}}<label class="wb-check-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="spendAp" {{#if spendAp}}checked{{/if}}> Spend AP ({{apLeft}} left)</label>{{/if}}
  <p class="wb-attack-range" hidden></p>
  {{#if target}}<p class="wb-dialog-meta">{{target.name}} · Evasion {{target.evasion}}</p>{{else}}<p class="wb-dialog-meta">No target · compare manually</p>{{/if}}
  <fieldset class="wb-dice-choices">
    <legend>Dice</legend>
    <label><input type="radio" name="rollMode" value="normal" {{#unless reasons.length}}checked{{/unless}}> Normal</label>
    <label data-tooltip="Roll two d20s; keep the higher"><input type="radio" name="rollMode" value="advantage"> Advantage</label>
    <label data-tooltip="Roll two d20s; keep the lower"><input
      type="radio"
      name="rollMode"
      value="disadvantage"
      {{#if reasons.length}}checked{{/if}}
    > Disadvantage</label>
  </fieldset>
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Attack help</summary><p>Target a token to compare with its Natural Evasion automatically. Advantage keeps the higher of two d20s; disadvantage keeps the lower. You may change the selected dice for other effects or corrections. With automatic resolution on, the target is asked how to defend and damage is applied for you; otherwise roll damage from the resulting chat card.</p><p>Spending is optional for practice. Loading weapons still use a shot. Two Light weapons may attack together for one attack's AP; the off-hand hit deals full dice damage without a modifier.</p></details>
</div>
